{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A set of wedding-themed outfits and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available in shops run by Matsuri and Kagari on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Includes a new Handcraft feature that allows you to embroider dresses and veils using the Master Embroidery Kit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This DLC includes the following items:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbOutfits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available at Matsuri Apparel on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Luxury Wedding Attire: White, Luxury Wedding Attire: Pink, Luxury Wedding Attire: Blue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbEquipment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available at Kagari Accouterments on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wedding Veil, Bridal Tiara</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbMaster Embroidery Kit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available at Flower Land in Yano Market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlocks new Handcraft recipes that let you embroider detailed designs onto deluxe wedding outfits and veils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203b This content can only be purchased once per account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203b If you uninstall the DLC after saving, that save data will no longer be loadable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203b The base game (sold separately) is required to use this content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please ensure your game is updated to the latest version if necessary.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612230?t=1748402583","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612230?t=1748402583","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612230/1d9bd1304b0413ab